WEBVTT

00:02:28.996 --> 00:02:33.356
And even better, many
of these solutions pay for themselves.

00:02:33.716 --> 00:02:36.756
The methane we emit
comes from three main sources:

00:02:36.796 --> 00:02:37.956
energy production,

00:02:37.996 --> 00:02:40.836
waste management and agriculture.

00:02:40.876 --> 00:02:43.436
The first category, energy production,

00:02:43.476 --> 00:02:46.516
is the largest and cheapest
opportunity we have

00:02:46.556 --> 00:02:48.156
to cut methane today.

00:02:48.156 --> 00:02:52.276
Most methane from energy
isn't from burning fossil fuels,

00:02:52.316 --> 00:02:55.156
it's from producing fossil fuels.

00:02:55.196 --> 00:02:58.196
Because natural gas,
which is mostly methane,

00:02:58.236 --> 00:03:00.636
can easily escape into the atmosphere